      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-253442-253597" style="padding-inline-start: 7em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-253463-253595"><seg source="#source-253463-253514">第二八二、シナ人のヤソ教に入るもの</seg></head>
        </div>
